# This directory is a workspace ROOT (pkg-index marker #2).
#
# There is no root CMakeLists.txt (RFC-0098 D9, phase-445 W5): a workspace is a
# directory of packages. The bringup is Form-1 — `src/pkg_rust_publisher`
# carries its own `system.toml` and `[image.native]` — and `nros build` builds
# every package the way colcon does, each with its own driver, into its own
# `build/<pkg>/`. This tracked marker is what says the directory is a
# workspace; without it the fixture builder (issue 1650) read the directory as
# a plain cmake project and found no CMakeLists.txt.
